{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cff55ef4-c0c3-88b2-ad36-5cb9c1b3e240",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T11:27:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Greg. My name is Rocco Pellegrino. I have a question about a shed, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. What's the question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I live at 444 Rhode Island Avenue, on the Hill. In the back yard there is a shed already, it is old. I want to move it, maybe ten feet, to the other side by the fence. Does moving it need a permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Moving an existing shed can trigger one, yeah. It depends on the size and how close it ends up to the property line. Do you know roughly how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, how do you say, um, [pause] pois, let me think. It is eight feet by ten feet, I believe. Not so tall. I am the renter, but the owner says it is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Since you're renting, the owner will probably need to sign off on the application, since it's his property. And with that size you'll want to check the setback from the lot line before you set it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I understand. And the fee, please? How much is the fee for this kind of permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact figure in front of me, and it can change. It's on the fee schedule on the city website, or I can have the office email... actually, better, I can mail you the application with the schedule. You'd get it in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is good. I am not so good with the computer. [pause] You know, I am on my best behavior for this call. I do not want to do anything wrong with the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, you're doing fine, Mr. Pellegrino. Nobody's in trouble. Let me get your mailing address, is it the same, 444 Rhode Island Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:26:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same. Four, four, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And a number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:05-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178, perfect. I'll put the shed application in the mail today. Fill it out, have the owner sign, and send a simple sketch showing where it's going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch, yes. Thank you very much, Mr. Greg. You have been very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T11:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
